{"unit_id":"AndroidSix__dsh-session-toolbox#card-zh","repo":"AndroidSix/dsh-session-toolbox","commit":"c4fd1828d189e6c1af7bf96a40db41b014af96a7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Toolbox 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话工具箱，通过插件侧栏界面及宿主服务管理项目、会话和本地数据。它支持图片草稿备份、会话迁移与归档还原、项目分组、消息引用和文件检查点恢复，也能在回答后生成可选的后续任务建议。适合需要整理项目会话、找回未发送图片或检查代码修改的 DSH 用户。工具箱状态保存在本机或浏览器；任务建议会使用 DSH 配置的模型服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:101-125","src/client.jsx:790-820","src/draft-vault.js:13-20"]}
{"unit_id":"AndroidSix__dsh-session-toolbox#card-en","repo":"AndroidSix/dsh-session-toolbox","commit":"c4fd1828d189e6c1af7bf96a40db41b014af96a7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Session Toolbox adds a panel to the DSH web client for organizing projects and sessions. It backs up image drafts, groups projects, moves sessions, restores archives, quotes messages, and records file checkpoints. It suggests follow-up requests. Data stays on the device or in browser storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:101-125","src/client.jsx:790-820","src/draft-vault.js:13-20"]}
