{"unit_id":"AndroidSix__dsh-session-toolbox#feature-1","repo":"AndroidSix/dsh-session-toolbox","commit":"c4fd1828d189e6c1af7bf96a40db41b014af96a7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Toolbox 的功能「图片草稿保险箱」：在浏览器本机备份输入框中的图片草稿，并按保留时间和容量清理旧备份；发送或移除图片后可清理对应记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/draft-vault.js:13-20","src/draft-vault.js:140-173"]}
{"unit_id":"AndroidSix__dsh-session-toolbox#feature-2","repo":"AndroidSix/dsh-session-toolbox","commit":"c4fd1828d189e6c1af7bf96a40db41b014af96a7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Toolbox 的功能「项目分组与迁移」：在项目管理界面创建、排序分组，并把项目及其会话迁移到新目录；迁移有日志，可在中断后继续完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/workspace.mjs:34-77","src/workspace.mjs:90-155"]}
{"unit_id":"AndroidSix__dsh-session-toolbox#feature-3","repo":"AndroidSix/dsh-session-toolbox","commit":"c4fd1828d189e6c1af7bf96a40db41b014af96a7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Toolbox 的功能「文件检查点」：在工具执行前后记录项目文件变化，用户可从消息操作入口查看并恢复检查点；遇到无法确认的情况会阻止不完整恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/checkpoints.mjs:130-180","src/client.jsx:790-820"]}
{"unit_id":"AndroidSix__dsh-session-toolbox#feature-4","repo":"AndroidSix/dsh-session-toolbox","commit":"c4fd1828d189e6c1af7bf96a40db41b014af96a7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Toolbox 的功能「消息引用与删除」：可引用整条消息或选中文本并带入输入框，也可删除符合条件的历史消息，使其从后续模型上下文中移除。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.jsx:790-820","src/messages.mjs:22-42"]}
{"unit_id":"AndroidSix__dsh-session-toolbox#feature-5","repo":"AndroidSix/dsh-session-toolbox","commit":"c4fd1828d189e6c1af7bf96a40db41b014af96a7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Toolbox 的功能「后续任务联想」：一轮回答结束后可生成最多三条后续请求候选，用户点击后填入输入框；模型调用使用 DSH 当前或单独指定的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/next-tasks.mjs:55-75","src/index.mjs:123-125"]}
{"unit_id":"AndroidSix__dsh-session-toolbox#caveat-1","repo":"AndroidSix/dsh-session-toolbox","commit":"c4fd1828d189e6c1af7bf96a40db41b014af96a7","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Toolbox 的使用前须知：开启后续任务联想会把最近对话中的有限文字内容交给所选模型服务；可关闭自动生成，图片、工具输出和思考过程不纳入该上下文。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/next-tasks.mjs:55-75","src/index.mjs:123-125"]}
